ssive track record, having played for several top-tier clubs in Turkey and abroad.\"}, {\"id\": \"s5\", \"text\": \"\\\"We are thrilled to welcome İlker to our team,\\\" said FC Grenchen's Sporting Director, Urs Müller, in an exclusive interview.\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"\\\"His experience and skillset will undoubtedly strengthen our squad and help us achieve our goals in the upcoming season.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"Tugal's move to FC Grenchen marks a significant coup for the Swiss club, which has been seeking to bolster its midfield options.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"The Turkish footballer's impressive stats, including 15 goals and 20 assists in his last 50 appearances, make him an attractive addition to the team.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"\\\"I am excited to join FC Grenchen and contribute to the team's success,\\\" Tugal said in a statement.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"\\\"I am looking forward to working with the coaching staff and my new teammates to achieve great things in Switzerland.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"Data from reputable football sources, including Transfermarkt and Sofascore, confirms Tugal's transfer to FC Grenchen.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"The Turkish footballer's profile on these platforms has been updated to reflect his new club affiliation.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"FC Grenchen, founded in 1906, has a rich history in Swiss football, having won several domestic titles and competed in European competitions.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"The club's fans, known for their passionate support, are eagerly anticipating Tugal's debut and the impact he will have on the team's performance.\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"As the football world continues to buzz with excitement about this transfer, one thing is clear: İlker Tugal's move to FC Grenchen is a significant development that will have far-reaching implications for the Swiss football scene.\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"